    "name": "Search Chained Parameter Test",
    "title": "Chained parameter tests",
    "status": "active",
    "description": "Tests chained search parameters: a chain filters by the referenced resource, may end on a string, token or _id parameter with its own modifier, may follow two references and repeating references into only the named type, and is rejected when ambiguous, too deep, or through a parameter that is not a reference.",
